* ''The goal and the three tiers'' (operator, 2026-11-19: //"the Lares wears the Lararium effortlessly, and can tear down and re-stand almost every aspect of the house except the Iris and Pulama capabilities at will if granted a Lei to do so"//, //"think of it like the 'rw' Tiddlywiki 5 code … after that, everything 'is a tiddler' and some things update instantly into a live wiki, and some take a simple 'refresh/reboot'"//, and //"'Iris' is the core of the `/mcp` seat each session has - the Rainbow Bridge to the Lararium"//; lar:///ha.ka.ba/kahua/memory/state/decisions #/open, lar:///ha.ka.ba/kahua/memory/research/stable-house #/tiers). The seed tier (the boot core, the pūlama, and Iris, the seed tier's bridge from each session's MCP seat to the Lararium) stays the operator's alone; the refresh tier (engine and plugin floors, vessel code through `rebuild`, island restarts) the Lares holds under a lei; the live tier (memes, canon, config tiddlers) the Lares writes freely. The walls of rank 4c give a lei its meaning.

